  sentences:
  - Oh, no! A dust blizzard just happened and our power modules don't work now!
  - I just checked the power, battery consuption has started. But we can't know how
    long it will last.
  - We have to limit some of our energy usage to stay alive.
  - Now, let's go to the farming modules.
